# CODEOWNERS for IqbalAI v2
#
# Every PR will automatically request review from the listed owners.
# On free private GitHub, this assigns reviewers but doesn't BLOCK merge
# (that requires paid Branch Protection / Rulesets). It's a soft signal
# that combined with BRANCHING.md and the PR template forms our review
# workflow. Treat any PR that merges without @abdurrehman-tahir approval
# as a process violation.
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Patterns follow .gitignore syntax.
# Last matching pattern wins, so put broad rules first, narrow ones last.

# Default owner for everything
*                                @abdurrehman-tahir

# Stack and architecture docs — extra explicit (any change requires approval)
/docs/STACK_LOCK.md              @abdurrehman-tahir
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md            @abdurrehman-tahir
/docs/DEVIATIONS.md              @abdurrehman-tahir
/docs/BRANCHING.md               @abdurrehman-tahir

# Enforcement scripts — touching these affects every other PR
/scripts/                        @abdurrehman-tahir
/.pre-commit-config.yaml         @abdurrehman-tahir
/.github/                        @abdurrehman-tahir

# Claude Code instructions
/.claude/                        @abdurrehman-tahir
